# fastlane/Matchfile -- Phase 8 (DIST-02) real appstore signing config.
# Replaces the Phase-1 placeholder (01-04-SUMMARY.md documented these exact swap targets):
#   the old local-disk git URL -> a PRIVATE https:// GitHub remote (the P1 placeholder pointed at
#                                 a local-only path under ~/Library; that scheme is now forbidden)
#   type("development") -> type("appstore")           (TestFlight uploads need appstore-signed builds)
#   app_identifier / team_id uncommented (read from ENV, never a hardcoded real id)
#
# SECRET DISCIPLINE (load-bearing, mirrors the Phase-1 threat model T-01-04-01 + this plan's
# T-08-04-02/03):
#   * The certs repo is PRIVATE. The git_url here is an https:// URL -- NEVER a local-disk URL
#     (a stale local mirror) and NEVER the ssh remote form (a user@host:path remote, which would
#     imply a deploy-key path leak). match-policy.sh forbids both the local-disk-URL scheme and the
#     ssh remote form and requires an https:// git_url; its self-test injects the real literal forms
#     to prove the gate bites.
#   * The match passphrase (which decrypts the stored certs) is read from ENV only -- it is NEVER
#     written as an inline string assignment here. match-policy.sh forbids any inline passphrase
#     assignment (an = or paren-call bound to a quoted string) and requires the ENV[ lookup form;
#     its self-test injects a real inline-assignment literal to prove the gate bites.
#
# WIRE-AND-GATE (CONTEXT D-01): this is a REAL appstore Matchfile NOW. The live `fastlane match`
# run is the Plan 07 never-auto-approve HUMAN-UAT gate -- it needs paid Apple Developer Program
# enrollment + the private cortex-fastlane-certs repo populated + MATCH_PASSWORD set in ENV.
# The day enrollment lands, `fastlane beta` runs match for real with no further code change.

git_url(ENV["MATCH_GIT_URL"] || "https://github.com/donovansantine/cortex-fastlane-certs.git")  # PRIVATE repo + ENV["MATCH_PASSWORD"]
git_branch("main")
storage_mode("git")
type("appstore")  # was "development" in Phase 1 -- appstore-signed builds for TestFlight (DIST-02/03)

app_identifier(["com.donovansantine.cortex.mac", "com.donovansantine.cortex.ios"])
team_id(ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"])  # read from ENV -- never a hardcoded real Developer Program team id

# The match passphrase is read from ENV by `match` itself (never declared here). Set it in your
# shell / CI secret store after enrollment via an exported MATCH_PASSWORD environment variable.
# The live match run is the Plan 07 gate.
